# S07-T02: Knowledge Slug `organization-planning`

## Objective

MCP knowledge slug for the Totem header → app-agent organization layer map. Project-agnostic.

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] MCP preflight — WARN if `:3000` down
- [ ] `explain("layer-cascade")` + `explain("feature-knowledge")`
